Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.12,0:01:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini, upacara minum teh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.64,0:01:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}di luar ruangan diadakan\Noleh Ekskul Upacara Minum Teh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.08,0:01:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih sudah datang membantu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.12,0:01:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sama-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.08,0:01:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih juga\Natas teh hitamnya yang enak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.62,0:01:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang, upacara minum teh luar ruangan\Ndi musim gugur...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.54,0:01:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}benar-benar luar biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.95,0:01:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pepohonan yang mulai berwarna-warni...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.87,0:01:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Langit tinggi, udara segar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.37,0:01:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dan yang paling top...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.08,0:01:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tehnya cepat dingin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.50,0:02:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.91,0:02:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau sekalian minum es teh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.29,0:02:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anu...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf mengganggu obrolan seru kalian.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamar kecilnya di mana, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.94,0:02:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Toilet, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di musim yang mulai dingin ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}menikmati dudukan kloset hangat\Ndi toilet umum
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.37,0:02:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}juga salah satu kenikmatan\Nupacara minum teh luar ruangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.66,0:02:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian pasti tidak bisa lepas darinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.45,0:02:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menemukan keanggunan di tempat begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Onsen terbuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke, terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.25,0:02:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Toiletnya bersih juga, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.20,0:02:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Coba toilet
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.27,0:02:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sekolah kita juga begini.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanti kuusulkan di rapat perwakilan murid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.95,0:02:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuncinya kenapa, nih?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.91,0:02:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Atau jangan-jangan aku terkunci?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.95,0:02:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak bisa dibuka...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.20,0:02:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ketua?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.79,0:02:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suara itu... Arisu?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.37,0:02:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah. Bisa bantu aku?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.45,0:02:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuncinya sepertinya rusak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.29,0:02:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.16,0:02:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anu...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa, Arisu?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.91,0:02:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tisu toiletnya habis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.33,0:03:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ekskul Upacara Minum Teh
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.04,0:03:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}benar-benar bikin tidak bisa lepas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.00,0:03:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Koma? Kaukah itu, Koma?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, kamu mungkin sudah dengar\Nsemuanya tadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.87,0:03:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu kamu keluar...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.75,0:03:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak bisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Toilet bidetnya rusak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.75,0:03:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak disangka kita bertiga...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.41,0:03:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.04,0:03:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.37,0:03:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.62,0:03:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya, coba tekan semua tombolnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin bisa diganti dengan fungsi lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.66,0:03:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bilas mode pijat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.25,0:03:36.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.54,0:03:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Komachan, tisu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.29,0:03:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lempar tisunya ke sini!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau aku bisa bergerak,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.63,0:03:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku bisa menolong kalian berdua.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.25,0:03:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.58,0:03:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tamatlah sudah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya, hubungi para cowok di luar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.70,0:03:57.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Minta mereka panggil anak\NEkskul Upacara Minum Teh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.13,0:03:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu sebentar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.04,0:04:00.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.29,0:04:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu, soalnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.41,0:04:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Malu banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.87,0:04:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih sempat mikirin itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.83,0:04:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya diputuskan bahwa\NKotobuki akan kabur lewat jendela.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tinggi juga, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kaki dulu, deh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.87,0:04:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, aku tidak berguna.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.32,0:04:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama ini kamu yang selalu kerja keras.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.33,0:04:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sesekali aku juga harus unjuk gigi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat, nyangkut!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.87,0:04:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dadanya...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.33,0:04:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ketua, ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat, cepat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.45,0:04:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau sampai ada yang lihat aku begini...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ketua...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.91,0:05:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.08,0:05:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau cari udara segar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pokoknya,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku panggil anak Ekskul Upacara Minum Teh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tarik! Tarik!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.62,0:05:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.87,0:05:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lima menit kemudian,\Nsemuanya berhasil diselamatkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.83,0:05:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tidak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Segini cukup?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah... sudah cukup, sungguh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.75,0:05:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ingatan soal toilet terus muncul,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.75,0:05:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bikin aku tidak bisa fokus belajar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ujian sudah dekat, aku ini mikirin apa, sih?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.91,0:05:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pula,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.00,0:05:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"mau cari udara segar" itu apaan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.16,0:05:51.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, yang bikin aku kepikiran,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.66,0:05:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}celana dalamku mungkin dilihat Mizunoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.41,0:05:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mana modelnya agak dewasa pula...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.22,0:05:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya kelihatan atau tidak?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seingatku kakiku rapat, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.21,0:06:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harusnya aman?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.91,0:06:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kalau dari sudutnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.16,0:06:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mending kubuktikan saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Supaya aku bisa fokus belajar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bang, Kakak lagi ngapain lagi, tuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.66,0:06:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Paling soal Ume lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.79,0:06:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Malas ngurusin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kira-kira begini.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.20,0:06:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dilihat dari tinggi badan Mizunoe\Ndan jaraknya,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.87,0:06:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}harusnya sudutnya segini.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau difoto begini, sempurna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.45,0:06:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus, rok dan celana dalamnya\Njuga harus sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.33,0:06:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kondisinya harus sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.41,0:06:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serius sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.20,0:06:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.66,0:06:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo kita foto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.45,0:06:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Malu juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.16,0:06:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sip, sudah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.50,0:06:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semoga dia tidak lihat...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.33,0:07:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata tidak kelihatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.33,0:07:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ih!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.79,0:07:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi beda dari bayanganku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.33,0:07:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, tidak, tidak, foto sekali lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ganti kondisi, pakai video.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seingatku roknya agak tersingkap,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.58,0:07:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kakinya juga agak lebih terbuka,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.83,0:07:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}terus aku bergerak-gerak mau lepas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ba-Bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.95,0:07:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.62,0:07:26.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.45,0:07:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mesum banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.08,0:07:28.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.70,0:07:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa-apaan ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.41,0:07:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aneh banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.33,0:07:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ternyata memamerkan pantat begini,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.08,0:07:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kayak di video dewasa,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}nyangkut di jendela.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.95,0:07:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak bisa kabur, tidak bisa bergerak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.95,0:07:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dalam keadaan tak berdaya begitu,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.14,0:07:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}seperti ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.83,0:07:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}pantatnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat, kelepasan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.54,0:08:11.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sama sekali tidak bisa belajar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.37,0:08:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kak, ngapain di kamar?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berisik banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.25,0:08:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pemeran Adegan Tersingkap Kocak:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.04,0:08:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Anggaran ekskul nambah lagi.\N- Honma Kuroe, Ekskul Renang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eksperimennya gagal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kabur...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang itu imut.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat siang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.04,0:08:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Halo,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku Janome dari Ekskul Makhluk Hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.75,0:08:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada yang mau kukonsultasikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.00,0:08:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Tahu sarang tawon di gerbang belakang?\N- Siapa dia? Ada perlu apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.83,0:08:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.75,0:08:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang lagi ramai dibicarakan, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Katanya ada murid yang tersengat juga.\NSeram.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.11,0:08:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, iya, itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.62,0:08:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Para guru juga lagi bahas mau\Npanggil jasa pembasmi atau tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.12,0:08:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya aku mau menyelamatkan mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.95,0:08:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka yang pasti akan dibunuh dengan kejam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.37,0:08:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Selamatkan tawonnya?\N- Sakit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.16,0:08:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.37,0:09:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Banyak banget sampai beterbangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.62,0:09:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kok bisa sarangnya dibiarkan sebesar ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu hasil kegiatan kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.41,0:09:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bikin masalah saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.66,0:09:11.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setiap kehidupan harus dilindungi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.50,0:09:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menjijikkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.79,0:09:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan dia orang berbahaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.58,0:09:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus sekarang bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.37,0:09:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana, ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.70,0:09:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku belum cari tahu caranya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.58,0:09:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kembalikan ke alam,\Nsetelah itu biarkan saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.83,0:09:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.25,0:09:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus, ada cara supaya tidak disengat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ajak bicara baik-baik saja, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.50,0:09:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semangat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.41,0:09:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang ini kenapa, sih?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.08,0:09:40.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa boleh buat, kita amati dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi sebelum itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.08,0:09:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa, Senior Terui?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau disengat, sakit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan kamu...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:49.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.83,0:09:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pada dasarnya aku memang suka serangga,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.83,0:09:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi melawan serangga\Nyang bisa menyengat dan terbang,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.70,0:09:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}peluang menangku kecil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.45,0:09:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Peluang menang?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.83,0:10:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada sekawanan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.95,0:10:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.16,0:10:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang terlalu nekat.\NPanggil jasa pembasmi saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Imutnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.12,0:10:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.70,0:10:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah apanya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.08,0:10:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bodoh, kamu ngapain?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.54,0:10:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, aku tidak tahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.45,0:10:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tawonnya ngamuk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:18.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.58,0:10:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kayak arwah penasaran.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.50,0:10:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harus bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.33,0:10:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Michinoku, ada ide bagus?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.29,0:10:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.12,0:10:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hohohohohohoho...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.45,0:10:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah disengat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.79,0:10:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kapan disengatnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.17,0:10:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Situasinya sudah tanpa harapan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.75,0:10:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar kalian. Giliranku turun tangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.04,0:10:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihat, kubereskan dalam sekejap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.66,0:10:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tawon itu bisa terbang, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.58,0:10:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar Tanchan yang maju pun, peluangnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.25,0:10:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa terus bahas peluang menang?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tenang saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.83,0:10:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimanapun juga,\Ntawon pasti tidak akan menyengatku.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.37,0:10:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Logika macam apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.91,0:10:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Kalau begitu, setidaknya...\N- Orang yang bisa diajak bicara?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.29,0:10:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begini cukup, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.79,0:10:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk barang seadanya...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.20,0:10:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini tidak bisa, lah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.87,0:11:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang agak norak, tapi lumayan, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.37,0:11:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski tidak terlalu berangin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.83,0:11:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lumayan dari mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.75,0:11:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Matamu itu mata faset tawon, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.25,0:11:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke, serbu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.17,0:11:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dapat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berhasil ditangkap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.09,0:11:14.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hebat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.70,0:11:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu benar-benar hebat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.08,0:11:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu boleh juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau gabung Ekskul Makhluk Hidup?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biasa saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.25,0:11:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tinggal bawa ini ke lahan kosong...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Puting Tan disengat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.58,0:11:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sakit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"Adik" Tan disengat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.50,0:11:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sakit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.41,0:11:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cepat tolong aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.45,0:11:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tan, tenang sedikit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.75,0:11:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wahai tawon, tenanglah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.83,0:11:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami bukan musuh kalian.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.54,0:11:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami ingin menyelamatkan kalian\Ndari tangan iblis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf terlambat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keesokan harinya, tawon berhasil dibasmi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Haum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.45,0:11:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bercanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan Janome suka padaku...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.95,0:11:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}The End.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.69,0:11:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitulah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:12:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekian laporan kegiatan minggu ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.75,0:12:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke, kerja bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.37,0:12:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kalau dipikir-pikir,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.37,0:12:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sekolah kita banyak orang aneh, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.91,0:12:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulai dari Ekskul Musik Modern\Nsampai Klub Riset Robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.66,0:12:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Juga kalian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.79,0:12:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.37,0:12:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, kami pulang dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.62,0:12:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.20,0:12:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dari adikku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.33,0:12:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Telepon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mizunoe, tunggu sebentar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Malam ini ada waktu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.79,0:12:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, jadi ini maksudnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.95,0:12:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya apa lagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.75,0:12:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sayur dan ikan pemberian orang tua murid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa aku yang angkut?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.95,0:12:43.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bu Guru tidak punya pacar?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.75,0:12:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa? Mau mencalonkan diri?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak boleh, Mizunoe.\NKita guru dan murid, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu menyebalkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.33,0:12:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Capek banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.87,0:12:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerja bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.79,0:12:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, aku pulang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masuk dulu, dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan, kubilang...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.04,0:13:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu mau Ibu ngurusin semua ini sendirian?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.83,0:13:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tahu Ibu tidak jago masak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.75,0:13:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi orang harus peka, dong, Perjaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.66,0:13:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masuk, jangan sungkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.95,0:13:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang ini masih saja...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.12,0:13:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dari dulu suka mempermainkanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.37,0:13:22.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mempermainkan kepolosanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu lihat, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.25,0:13:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang anak cowok SMP, matanya jeli.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.87,0:13:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi sampai mengajakku ke rumahnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.45,0:13:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Entah apa maunya,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.25,0:13:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi aku tidak akan terpancing lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ngapain? Cepat masuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.08,0:13:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berhenti buka-buka baju terus!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.62,0:13:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulai memasak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.04,0:13:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mulai, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:43.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang jago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.62,0:13:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya aku masak tiap hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah mulai minum!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.16,0:13:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Entah kenapa ada di kulkas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ngelesnya puitis sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.25,0:13:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini di depan murid, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, Ibu yang urus bumbunya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.08,0:14:05.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Katanya sake bikin daging lebih empuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.66,0:14:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hentikan, bodoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Silakan minum diam-diam di sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.20,0:14:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.20,0:14:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bu Guru kayaknya lagi senang, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.29,0:14:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mizunoe,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.70,0:14:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bagaimana di OSIS?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.87,0:14:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berkat Ibu, aku senang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.70,0:14:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, begitu, begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.70,0:14:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu suka semua anggota OSIS?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa dibilang begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah beberapa bulan juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.45,0:14:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku berterima kasih pada mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.37,0:14:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga suka mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.16,0:14:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus, kamu suka Michinoku?\NSecara seksual?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.95,0:14:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Ibu dengar gosip soal "kawin".\N- Ibu ngomong begitu lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.83,0:14:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tahu begini, tadi tidak usah jawab serius.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.45,0:14:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, Ibu bukan mau mengerjaimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.58,0:14:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asal kalian akur, Ibu senang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.04,0:15:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga suka Michinoku, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.08,0:15:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ketua...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.29,0:15:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga suka Ketua, Senior Terui, dan Tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.08,0:15:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekalian Ibu juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.83,0:15:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu cuma sekalian?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.12,0:15:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.33,0:15:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu baik banget padaku\Nyang dulu begitu susah diatur.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.29,0:15:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sudah dewasa, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.50,0:15:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu yang dulu baca "Seratus Tahun Kesunyian"\Ndi pojok kelas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan dibahas!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.66,0:15:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo makan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.66,0:15:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.54,0:15:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.62,0:15:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Piringnya kebanyakan, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.87,0:15:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata kamu tidak sadar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, makan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.58,0:15:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Ume?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.12,0:15:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.66,0:15:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kamu ada di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.87,0:16:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Michinoku, itu beha Ibu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.33,0:16:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah, kukira jatuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.25,0:16:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begini sudah sopan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus protes dari mana dulu?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitulah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu semacam jadi wali Michinoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.95,0:16:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"Begitulah" apanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.75,0:16:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku baru tahu sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.25,0:16:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kami tinggal di kamar sebelah-sebelahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.29,0:16:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan masalah besar, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.45,0:16:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.45,0:16:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma masak dan cuci baju.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.70,0:16:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hubungannya sebatas itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.00,0:16:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kayak ngurus kucing liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.95,0:16:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, orang tuanya...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.45,0:16:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka sejak lama...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.25,0:16:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setop, tidak usah dilanjutkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.75,0:16:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya aku menanyakan\Nhal yang tidak seharusnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.25,0:16:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.20,0:16:54.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Empatimu tinggi juga, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.75,0:16:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah meninggal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.87,0:16:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah lama, jadi tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.29,0:16:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tetap dilanjutkan juga?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.70,0:17:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitulah kami hidup santai bersama.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.57,0:17:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi sudah setengah tahun lebih, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.70,0:17:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Michinoku,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.66,0:17:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dulu kamu lebih murung, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.50,0:17:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.82,0:17:17.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang ekspresimu jauh lebih cerah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.61,0:17:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini juga berkat OSIS...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan, berkat kamu, Mizunoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.50,0:17:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa jadi aku?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.61,0:17:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang bikin Michinoku semanja ini\Ncuma kamu, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.91,0:17:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya dia sangat peduli\Npendapat orang lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.25,0:17:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena kelihatan sibuk, dia menunggu\Ntanpa mengganggu selama dua jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.54,0:17:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Butuh waktu lama baginya\Nuntuk terbiasa di OSIS.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.54,0:17:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.12,0:17:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biasanya,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.16,0:17:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}seenaknya duduk di pangkuanmu\Nitu sudah aneh, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.20,0:17:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.66,0:17:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, Bu Guru,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.91,0:17:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dari tadi, bukankah Ibu
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:17:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}terlalu dekat denganku?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.04,0:18:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.45,0:18:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, sekarang ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:03.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pula, bau alkohol banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.33,0:18:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kamu bilang begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.83,0:18:12.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ketiduran.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.62,0:18:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enak banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.12,0:18:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf seadanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.87,0:18:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ume mau pulang?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.77,0:18:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, aku pamit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.66,0:18:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bu Guru juga sudah tidur.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.75,0:18:25.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, aku antar ke depan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.12,0:18:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.66,0:18:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kenapa Michinoku lengket banget sama aku?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.08,0:18:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, ngomong begini tidak sopan, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.85,0:18:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu karena...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.45,0:18:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rahasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.33,0:18:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa, sih?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.95,0:18:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.04,0:18:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar, pakai "heh" segala.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.66,0:18:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku cuma mau coba bilang begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.58,0:18:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku lihat di buku.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.66,0:18:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, ya, benar juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.70,0:19:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begini saja sudah cukup.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.95,0:19:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.08,0:19:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.45,0:19:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aduh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.66,0:19:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Ketua!\N- Sakit...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.25,0:19:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mizunoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.66,0:19:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa Ketua ke sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.83,0:19:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, aku menabrakmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.41,0:19:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, tak apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.53,0:19:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada ikan sanma mentah\Nditaruh di meja Bu Guru,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.54,0:19:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi kuantarkan...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.29,0:19:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa Mizunoe ada di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.83,0:19:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Itu karena...\N- Mizunoe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.12,0:19:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebelum pergi, selimuti Ibu, dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.54,0:19:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kotobuki, ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.12,0:19:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau ikut "main" juga?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.41,0:19:33.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Punya Ume enak banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.95,0:19:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"Main"? Enak banget?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.58,0:19:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.66,0:19:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan seperti yang Ketua pikirkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.37,0:19:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah itu, dia pun ikut "main" sepuasnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.41,0:19:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya aku melewatkan kejadian penting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.45,0:19:48.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ngomong apa, sih?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.58,0:19:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.37,0:19:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.41,0:19:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.58,0:19:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kok kalian yang pasang muka bangga?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.50,0:21:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat pagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.12,0:21:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat makan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.91,0:21:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebentar lagi tiba\Ndi Halte SMP Wakaba Daiichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.87,0:22:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penumpang yang akan turun...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.70,0:22:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menurutmu soalnya kali ini susah, tidak?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.16,0:22:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.12,0:22:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Parah, aku dapat 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.25,0:22:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misa?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.54,0:22:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku 86.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.66,0:22:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hebat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.33,0:22:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, 'kan? Bu Guru juga memujiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.08,0:22:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau serius, kamu bisa juga, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.20,0:22:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enak, ya. Hebat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.75,0:22:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Karaoke, yuk.\N- Kegiatan ekskul bikin malas.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.29,0:23:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Michinoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.25,0:23:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.37,0:23:16.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita harus ke OSIS.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.16,0:23:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.33,0:23:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nilaimu kali ini bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.91,0:23:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}100.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.95,0:23:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serius?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.25,0:23:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin bisa kayak kamu.
